{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "10c9730dd2f9a3fb428af9fc5c4c70070a54414401678ca5539aaff091ee60df", "ja": "（『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演の成功を受け、\n今日はトッテモタカイツリーでミニライブだ！）", "zh": "（『Sunshine Rhythm!』的公演圆满成功，\n今天要在高耸入云塔举办迷你演唱会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "7fd9848cfd1fe6294dd1bc58afa1cb8d2bebe1c6c9f96bd32dd251a59305b0b6", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん♪\n可奈は今日も、がんばりま～す♪", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生♪\n可奈今天也会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "73ead3f425a83a1a304c77b8f23cf7e6643588bd3a7916e815174ec3c6bdd97a", "ja": "ああ、トッテモタカイツリーは、前にみんなで来た\n思い出の場所だしな。張り切って行こう！", "zh": "嗯，之前大家也有一起来高耸入云塔，\n留下了美好的回忆，今天就好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "03164bccd72b707740d5a162e52f4f3ccd78e285a1067f6cd776b2c89339912a", "ja": "はい！　私、一生懸命、楽しく歌いますね！\n歌のお仕事～♪　トッテモトッテモ、ユカイナリ～♪", "zh": "是！我会竭尽所能欢唱的！\n唱歌的工作～♪真的有够真的有够、愉快～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6818a73cc66a17d1833cfd1df4434096fc6ef9b2b060b56c169c369939d63239", "ja": "……可奈は本当に歌が好きだよな。\nなんでもすぐに歌にできるなんて、感心するよ。", "zh": "……可奈真的很喜欢唱歌呢。\n不管什么都能马上唱成歌，真让我佩服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "ce44404b60e96198fd14dd440aff7c906c1e912c7817421f47880532e14fd6d2", "ja": "えへ♪　考えてるわけじゃないんですけど……\n私、いつの間にか歌っちゃうみたいで。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我并没有特意去想些什么……\n不知不觉间就唱出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "16e4fc53a727abd629d41c56309c4fc8dd13a7ed645ed937d565f1397612c93f", "ja": "あ、だからBGMが欲しい時は言ってくださいね！\n可奈はジュークボックス～♪　なにかを歌う～♪", "zh": "啊，想要BGM的时候就告诉我吧！\n可奈是点唱机～♪会随便唱点什么～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c07d9f34d36f6e676257a6e881e49a8092707a78214f4f031675f96b202cfb0", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。じゃあ楽しい気持ちに\nなりたい時は、可奈に頼もうかな？", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。\n那我需要愉快一下的时候，就拜托可奈啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "1453815ece97fe8f13f5bd44486ea73c06683116b0da195335842c77c67ccf32", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんも、私の歌で\n楽しい気持ちになってくれてるんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生\n听我唱歌也会变得愉快吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d4432eccd420a717f1f3e33a01295529d60267dafe46924c7eca57fe30a75ccc", "ja": "もちろん。可奈のウキウキした気持ちが、\n歌と一緒に、たくさん伝わってくるから。", "zh": "当然会啊，因为可奈雀跃的心情\n会随着歌声一起传到我心里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "73cc4f91e218d74da13799ed4e6db052e35313dc3fb06adac350f88777cf4b2a", "ja": "わぁ、よかったです！\n私の歌、ちゃんと役に立つんですね！", "zh": "哇，太好了！\n我唱歌是真的有用处的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "a30608a0b78ffcfb6f1bb735cd62c465cf87668bbc11511001f2e34cbb1065d5", "ja": "歌と一緒に、私の気持ちが伝わっちゃうって思うと、\nなんか恥ずかしいですけど……。えへへ♪", "zh": "一想到自己的心情会随着歌声传给别人，\n就觉得有点害羞……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "a7d5947b631d1ba27bd78cde92587da8da146a399da3c993911a8d285a79e970", "ja": "あれ？　……あ、そっか！\nそうすればいいのかも！", "zh": "奇怪？\n……啊，对了！这么做就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dce46db407213844f1c6599a9d52b225d41efe12f5338cc9bd2d4f54c32aed9e", "ja": "可奈？　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "可奈？你怎这么突然？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "47a5a6d9042e9a2c0f56bc60f0d54d4b9d804034b96e059f28d7bfee9618b019", "ja": "気持ちです、{$P$}さん！\n私、ちゃんとネコの気持ちになれてませんでした！", "zh": "就是心情啊，{$P$}先生！\n我没有好好去思考猫咪的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1015_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "063e946f92e2803d3a3455dbb38c47fc7ed1cf7f82969999b746f3ad8934cae6", "ja": "私、ネコの集会を見つけると、つい嬉しくなっちゃって\n歌いながら混ざるんですけど……。", "zh": "我只要看到猫咪聚集在一起，\n就会开心唱歌想靠近牠们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "29296ffde4882688c271c0c55f3ee33905eebc3961ba9c228cfe5591be80c3ea", "ja": "でも、みんなすぐいなくなっちゃうんです……。", "zh": "可是，大家都一溜烟就跑掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1af7339f3d3022bb6503aa542970a2ef9a0af8bb1cc32505a397becf2100dfa3", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\nいきなりだと、猫もびっくりするだろうしな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n你这么突然，猫咪会吓到也是没办法的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "05f640978ec291174bc2ea025c799442f580833aed300245ad764e7a42447048", "ja": "だから次から、もっとネコらしい、嬉しい気持ちとか\n楽しい気持ちになって歌うことにしますね！", "zh": "所以从下次开始，我要更像猫咪一点，\n用高兴、快乐的心情去唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee88fd0205b93d5ee9a46a41a2cd5ca07bc99a6d8c16b1d64bf08e9bb58106e6", "ja": "お腹まんぷく、にゃんにゃんにゃん～♪\nノドをごろごろ、にゃんにゃんにゃん～♪", "zh": "肚子吃饱饱，喵喵喵～♪\n喉咙呼噜呼噜，喵喵喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3e00d256a400b8779bcc374fd031261a87f4e2ba82ce5d9a6d76fe127c379b40", "ja": "はは、猫らしくか。\n確かにその方が、猫にも馴染みやすそうだ。", "zh": "哈哈，更像猫咪啊。\n这样似乎确实比较容易融入猫群呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1022_p", "source_sha256": "62167e7f56a34d9a33675f6a89b8223c643e4a77f36d02267adf33437facb451", "ja": "可奈が本当に猫の気持ちになれるようになったら、\n猫達の方から集まってくるかもな！", "zh": "等可奈真的能揣摩出猫咪的心情，\n说不定猫咪们会自己靠过来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "8ec4425bc20086edb241b6936b26d8ff2ff1ee2be3bceb6f56247dd85ab0a9b4", "ja": "私が歌うとネコが……！\nわぁ、できたらすごいですっ♪", "zh": "我一唱歌猫咪就会……！\n哇，要是那样就太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1024_p", "source_sha256": "71c1e1a5621871bb40432b97ecf01d6d169de763761b0a88010258bc06fad87d", "ja": "でも今日のところは、\n来てくれたお客さんの気持ちで頼むぞ！", "zh": "不过今天，\n就先麻烦你设想前来捧场的观众心情啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "668b28fbb41043f61c5c9946474b899cb9945950508adb9ff298e057a475bd76", "ja": "はい！　ウキウキなお買いもの気分で、\nウキウキな笑顔になってもらって……。", "zh": "好！我就用雀跃的逛街心情，\n让大家露出开怀笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0083_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbedaa4cadd8d109eaa3ba4294d62ac399aa41bf95da718c18714e0381f7a2d8", "ja": "いつか人もネコも、街中のみんな、みんなに！\n笑顔になってもらえるように、頑張りますね♪", "zh": "不管是人还是猫咪，街上的大家都能露出笑容！\n为了这一天，我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
